Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 23:56:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add V3 industry intelligence, contact discovery, golden
 scoring, and 3-hour scheduled updates

- Industry classification + live industry radar + under-the-radar hidden-fit jobs
- Contact discovery and outreach that never fabricate data (UNKNOWN when no evidence)
- Golden opportunity score that keeps contact from dominating a better fit
- Scheduler now supports every-3-hours mode (realistic jobs only), via schedule preference
- Outreach fix: parse JSON-string skill_gap_matrix to stop 500 on /api/jobs/<id>/outreach
- Frontend V3 compact Today cards + job contact/outreach block
- Tests: golden, industry, contact intelligence, outreach (all passing)

Co-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
